SUMMARY:Friday Weekly DJ's
DESCRIPTION:Although we are primarily a Live Music Calendar\, we often come across Electronic & DJ events in the area and list them for you as we find out about them. Please verify the DJ\, times and cover charges with the venue. \nLA Pizza Party Rooftop – 6-9pm \nThe Barn at Mills River Brewery – 6-10pm \nThe Radical – 6-11pm \nPotential New Boyfriend – 7:30-11pm \nCapella On 9 – 8-11pm \nBen’s Tune Up – 8-11pm \nAntidote – 9-11pm \nBanks Ave – 9-11:30pm \nVOWL – 9pm-1am \nDouble Crown – 9pm-2am \nHavana Miami – 9pm-2am \nStatic Age Loft – 9pm-2am \nWaterstreet – 9pm-2am \nLa Pizza Party – 10pm-2am \nThe Barksdale – 10pm-2am \nLazy Diamond – 10pm-2am \nSticks On Broadway – 10pm-2am \nStrange Magic Bar – 10pm-2am \nShakeys – 10pm-2am \n  \nVerify with the venue on times\, cover charges and tonight’s DJ.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/friday-weekly-dj-schedule/2026-05-15/
LOCATION:Asheville Area
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic
END:VEVENT
