DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260516T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260516T160000
SUMMARY:Wine Afternoon at Marked Tree Vineyard — Introverts Edition
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n🍇 Cross-posted with Asheville Transpl
 ants group\n**New to Asheville and haven't explored the local wine scene y
 et? Same. Let's fix that — over a glass at Marked Tree Vineyard.**\nWe'r
 e spending a relaxed Saturday afternoon at Marked Tree Vineyard\, one of t
 he prettiest spots in the area — sweeping mountain views\, a great pour 
 list\, and plenty of room to spread out and chat. It's about a 30-minute s
 cenic drive from Asheville\, in Flat Rock\, NC.\nThis is low-key\, no pres
 sure — just a group of introverts who'd rather share a glass of wine wit
 h new friends than scroll Netflix alone on a Saturday. Whether you're a wi
 ne snob or a "I'll have whatever's good" person\, you belong here.\n**The 
 Plan:**\n• 1:00 PM — Meet at Marked Tree Vineyard\n• 1:00–4:00 PM 
 — Tastings\, lounging\, and conversation on the patio\n**What to Know:**
 \n• Tasting fees are on your own (typically around $10–20)\n• Drivin
 g required — Marked Tree is about 30 min from downtown Asheville\n• Do
 g-friendly on the patio (worth a quick call ahead if you're bringing one)\
 n• Light bites are usually available on-site\, or grab a late lunch on t
 he way back\nSpace is limited to 20 so we can actually get to know each ot
 her. Grab your spot!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314507057
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260427T135716Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T135716Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Psychedelic Society Of Asheville": "https://www.meetup.com/psychedelic-society-of-asheville/events/314230848/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_psychedelic_society_of_asheville
X-SOURCE:Psychedelic Society of Asheville
UID:event_314230848@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260516T035117Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260516T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260516T153000
SUMMARY:Psychedelic Integration Circle
DESCRIPTION:Psychedelic Society of Asheville\nSome experiences change us b
 efore we fully understand how. Through reflection\, shared wisdom\, and ge
 nuine community\, this circle offers a safe and confidential space to make
  meaning of your experiences\, and to let that meaning actually land in yo
 ur life.\n\nWhen we integrate with intention\, we move through change with
  greater clarity\, resilience\, and compassion for ourselves and others.\n
 \nWe are delighted to welcome Becca Marshall as our circle holder. Becca i
 s an Integrative Psychotherapist\, Aligned Living Coach\, Psychedelic Inte
 gration Guide\, and founder of [ActivXchange](https://www.activxchange.com
 /) — Her work supports people navigating significant life transitions\, 
 entering adulthood\, stepping into leadership\, moving through healing and
  transformation\, with grounded presence and genuine care.\n\nThis circle 
 is open to anyone curious\, those actively preparing for or integrating an
  experience\, and those who have been walking this path for years. Our int
 ention is simple: to foster connection\, shared wisdom\, and mutual suppor
 t within our growing community here in Asheville. All are welcome.\n\nA su
 ggested donation of $10 helps cover venue costs and support future PSA off
 erings. No one will ever be turned away for lack of funds.\n\nWe look forw
 ard to being in circle with you. 💫
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/psychedelic-society-of-asheville/even
 ts/314230848/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260411T152420Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T152420Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
