SUMMARY:Curated Conversations
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nJoin us on Tuesday\, May 19 for the next o
 f our **Curated Conversations**\, a series of in-person events for single 
 Digital Nomads who seek **meaningful connections and monogamous relationsh
 ips**. We'll be outside at our new host venue\, The Mule at Devil's Foot B
 everages\, so if you're hungry or thirsty\, order to your heart's content.
  Then come meet us and have fun while working on social skills. We'll prac
 tice how to approach someone you're interested in. Bring a friend or two w
 ho's single and up for **participating and mingling**.\n\n**This isn't mat
 chmaking**\; it's guided\, strategic\, inclusive\, and dynamic activities 
 designed to provoke thoughtful dialogue.\n\nOur host venue\, The Mule\, ha
 s parking is available in the lot on the north side of the building\, clos
 e to the outside space where we'll be. Look for the Digital Nomads table a
 nd fill out a name tag to make introductions easier.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/314321384/
