X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup She Owns It Avl": "https://www.meetup.com/she-owns-it-avl/events/314373900/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_she_owns_it_avl
X-SOURCE:She Owns It AVL
UID:event_314373900@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260516T035118Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260520T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260520T200000
SUMMARY:✨ She Owns It AVL ✨
DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n✨ **She Owns It Meetup** ✨\n\n**May
  Featured Guest: Tera Pruett\,** founder of Unstoppable Rebel Collective A
 VL — an endurance coach and personal trainer who helps women build stren
 gth\, resilience\, and confidence from the inside out.\n\n**Tera will tell
  her story** — how she got here\, what shaped her path\, and the moments
  that pushed her to grow. Through her work\, she helps women step beyond t
 heir limits\, trust themselves more deeply\, and tap into a strength they 
 didn’t know they had.\n\n✨Each month\, **She Owns It AVL** gathers wom
 en ready to grow\, connect\, and belong. We focus on life\, money\, mindse
 t\, and wellness — creating space for real conversations\, meaningful re
 lationships\, and lasting connection and inspiration.\n\nWe can’t wait t
 o see you there! 💫\nCome early to connect! 5:30\n\nWe’re so grateful 
 for everyone who signs up to join us! If your plans shift\, please update 
 your RSVP—it helps us plan the evening and make space for other women wh
 o’d love to attend.
