X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260525T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260525T140000
DTSTAMP:20260515T235115
CREATED:20260324T165710Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T160920Z
UID:10017010-1779714000-1779717600@www.ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:The United States Air Force Heritage of America Band Quintet
DESCRIPTION:The United States Air Force Heritage of America Band Quintet\nMonday May 25\, 2026\n1:00 – 2:00 p.m.\nBaker Event Lawn\n\nJoin us for a free performance from The Quintet with Heritage of America Band in honor of Memorial Day. Veterans park free on Memorial Day.  \n\nDiscover the sounds of the coast with Langley Winds! This exceptional wind quintet\, serving from the historic Langley Air Force Base\, brings a fresh perspective to chamber music. These five dedicated Air Force musicians deliver a performance that’sboth captivating and distinctly their own. \nWhile sharing the Air Force’s mission to honor veterans\, inspire patriotism\, andconnect communities\, Langley Winds brings a unique energy to every stage. Fromtimeless classics to contemporary masterpieces\, their dynamic repertoire showcasesboth artistry and innovation. Experience the spirit of America through the sounds of Langley Winds! \nActivated in 1941\, The United States Air Force Heritage of America Band has a rich history of inspiring public patriotism and enhancing esprit de corps among all the US military service branches. These world-class musicians are stationed at Joint Base Langley-Eustis in Hampton\, Virginia. They travel throughout the Carolinas\, Mid-Atlantic and Northeast regions\, presenting over 350 events annually for the generalpublic and in support of Airman morale and protocol events. \nThe USAF Heritage of America Band remains at the forefront of communicating AirForce core values and preserving and enriching America’s military and musicalheritage into the 21st century. \n\n\n\nThere is no cost to attend this event. Standard parking fees apply.
URL:https://www.ncarboretum.org/event/the-united-states-air-force-heritage-of-america-band-quintet/
LOCATION:Baker Event Lawn
CATEGORIES:Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Langley-Winds-Photo.jpg
END:VEVENT
